    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Executive Summary\n",
        "\n",
        "The Duka Electronics dataset contains 1,000 sales orders from 5 branches between January and June 2026.\n",
        "\n",
        "Nairobi branch generated the highest revenue of KES 26,106,100 from 376 orders.\n",
        "\n",
        "Laptops generated the highest product revenue of KES 41,535,000, while tablets recorded the highest sales volume at 691 units.\n",
        "\n",
        "Weekdays recorded 723 orders, compared to 277 orders on weekends.\n",
        "\n",
        "Weekend orders had a higher average order revenue of KES 71,972.20, compared to KES 71,723.65 on weekdays."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "UaZ2eyje9_BP"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Mobile** **money** **agent** **network**\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "zb7vKUI3F8FL"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "%%writefile agent_generator.py\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "\n",
        "rng = np.random.default_rng(44)\n",
        "\n",
        "n = 600\n",
        "\n",
        "agents = pd.DataFrame({\n",
        "    \"agent_id\": [f\"AG{i:03d}\" for i in range(1, 21)],\n",
        "    \"county\": rng.choice([\"Nairobi\", \"Kiambu\", \"Nakuru\", \"Mombasa\", \"Kisumu\"], 20),\n",
        "    \"onboarded\": pd.date_range(\"2024-01-01\", periods=20, freq=\"MS\")\n",
        "                   .strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "txns = pd.DataFrame({\n",
        "    \"txn_id\": [f\"TX{i:05d}\" for i in range(1, n + 1)],\n",
        "    \"agent_id\": rng.choice(agents[\"agent_id\"], n),\n",
        "    \"txn_type\": rng.choice([\"Deposit\", \"withdrawal\", \"DEPOSIT \",\n",
        "                            \"Withdrawal\", \"deposit\"], n),\n",
        "    \"amount\": rng.lognormal(7.5, 0.8, n).round(0).astype(str),\n",
        "    \"txn_date\": (pd.to_datetime(\"2026-03-01\")\n",
        "                 + pd.to_timedelta(rng.integers(0, 60, n), unit=\"D\"))\n",
        "                .strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "idx = rng.choice(n, 30, replace=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "txns.loc[idx[:15], \"amount\"] = np.nan\n",
        "txns.loc[idx[15:20], \"amount\"] = \"N/A\"\n",
        "txns.loc[idx[20:25], \"amount\"] = \"250000\"\n",
        "txns.loc[idx[25:], \"txn_date\"] = txns.loc[idx[25:], \"txn_date\"].str.replace(\"-\", \"/\")\n",
        "\n",
        "txns = pd.concat([txns, txns.sample(12, random_state=1)], ignore_index=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "txns.loc[rng.choice(len(txns), 8, replace=False), \"agent_id\"] = \"AG099\"\n",
        "\n",
        "agents.to_csv(\"agents.csv\", index=False)\n",
        "txns.to_csv(\"agent_transactions.csv\", index=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Both CSV files have been created successfully.\")\n",
        "print(\"Agents:\", agents.shape)\n",
        "print(\"Transactions:\", txns.shape)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "p6QMCTrQ-l4H",
        "outputId": "4d60e768-2b55-47af-a673-cc30f7c178d4"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Overwriting agent_generator.py\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
