    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "kept the 20 missing amounts as NaN because their actual values are unknown, so I did not want to guess or replace them with zero. I added an amount_flag column to identify transactions with missing amounts for future review."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "h6-mLCYTUDi-"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Calculate the lower and upper quartiles\n",
        "Q1 = txns[\"amount\"].quantile(0.25)\n",
        "Q3 = txns[\"amount\"].quantile(0.75)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate the IQR\n",
        "IQR = Q3 - Q1\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate the outlier limits\n",
        "lower_limit = Q1 - 1.5 * IQR\n",
        "upper_limit = Q3 + 1.5 * IQR\n",
        "\n",
        "# Flag suspicious amounts\n",
        "txns[\"outlier_flag\"] = (\n",
        "    (txns[\"amount\"] < lower_limit) |\n",
        "    (txns[\"amount\"] > upper_limit)\n",
        ")\n",
        "print(\"Lower limit:\", lower_limit)\n",
        "print(\"Upper limit:\", upper_limit)\n",
        "print(\"Number of outliers:\", txns[\"outlier_flag\"].sum())"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "nmLkr3oRUW7t",
        "outputId": "7b044da4-4f49-40d1-80ea-3dbdfd3cf976"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Lower limit: -1927.5\n",
            "Upper limit: 6084.5\n",
            "Number of outliers: 40\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
