      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Privacy and Data Protection\n",
        "\n",
        "If the dataset also contained customer phone numbers, the phone numbers and any customer names or details that identify a person would be personal data. Under the Kenya Data Protection Act, 2019, the business should protect this information by allowing only authorised people to access it, keeping it secure, and not sharing it without a valid reason. It should only collect information that is needed and delete it when it is no longer required."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "mSEgMQxzlw6X"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Data Quality Report\n",
        "1. Completeness\n",
        "Some transaction amounts were missing or invalid. These values were converted to missing values (NaN) and flagged for review rather than replaced with guessed amounts.\n",
        "2. Uniqueness\n",
        "The dataset contained 12 duplicate transactions. They were removed using the transaction ID to ensure each transaction appears only once.\n",
        "3. Validity\n",
        "Transaction types were standardised to Deposit and Withdrawal. Amounts were converted to numeric values, and transaction dates were converted to a consistent date format.\n",
        "4. Consistency\n",
        "Different spellings and capitalisation of transaction types were corrected. Date formats were also standardised.\n",
        "5. Accuracy\n",
        "Five unusually high transaction amounts of KES 250,000 were flagged as outliers for further checking. Unknown agent IDs were also flagged.\n",
        "6. Timeliness\n",
        "Transaction dates cover March and April 2026. The dates were converted into a standard format to support weekly analysis."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "9gba7Ui4RN4v"
      }
    }
  ]
